# Runnable examples (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP client).
# Start the stack first: docs/api/guides/getting-started.md

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List active exercises, sorted by name
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises

### Filter: family 1, difficulty 1
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises?family_id=1&difficulty=1&sort=name

### Search by name, include inactive exercises
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises?q=pigeon&include_inactive=true

### One exercise with joints, muscles and graphs
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises/1

### Families
GET {{base}}/api/v1/families

### Error: unknown exercise (404 not_found)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises/9999

### Error: invalid filter (422 validation_error)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises?difficulty=7

### Error: correlate with your own request id
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exercises?mode=yoga
X-Request-ID: my-test-request-1
